  "solution": {
    "text": "Hints: $1+x=\\log _a a+\\log _a b c=\\log _a a b c$\n$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\frac{1}{1+x}=\\log _{a b c} a, \\text { Similarly } \\frac{1}{1+y}=\\log _{a b c} b \\\\\n& \\frac{1}{1+z}=\\log _{a b c} c \\text {, Ans. }=\\log _{(a b c)} a b c=1\n\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
